1
00:00:40,300 --> 00:00:41,840
But it's not my fault I talk like

2
00:00:41,840 --> 00:00:44,020
this. It's the French language's fault,

3
00:00:44,020 --> 00:00:45,520
because this language wasn't created

4
00:00:45,520 --> 00:00:46,750
by linguists.

5
00:00:46,800 --> 00:00:48,840
It was created by artists.

6
00:00:48,840 --> 00:00:50,410
Abstract expressionism.

7
00:00:51,600 --> 00:00:53,830
I take an E, an A and a U…

8
00:00:54,340 --> 00:00:55,750
…and I pronounce it "O". (eau = water)

9
00:00:58,650 --> 00:01:00,400
Then I add an X…

10
00:01:01,130 --> 00:01:02,240
…but I don't pronounce it.

11
00:01:05,320 --> 00:01:07,340
That's why if one day I were

12
00:01:07,340 --> 00:01:09,320
shipwrecked on a desert island, I hope

13
00:01:09,320 --> 00:01:10,880
that island isn't French-speaking, because

14
00:01:10,880 --> 00:01:12,690
I'd never get off that island.

15
00:01:12,720 --> 00:01:14,600
Because the word "HELP" is a thousand times

16
00:01:14,600 --> 00:01:16,500
easier to write in the sand than

17
00:01:16,500 --> 00:01:17,510
"AU SECOURS", OK?
